  message: "F5 DEEP bakeoff validation COMPLETE (deep-20260623-134237/cohort-001/iter-001; 8-repo cohort express/apollo-server/caddy/spring-petclinic/zoxide/SwiftyJSON/pretix/sherpa-csharp). Deterministic matrix: all 8 langs emit field, 6 emit variable, all canonical stable_id, 0 per-file collisions, 0 incomplete; Java decorator bonus 48 decorated_by edges on fields. Adversarial ground-truth audit (8 skeptics vs real source): python/javascript/typescript/java/rust CONFIRMED right-reason (12/12 each; instance-attrs/object-literals/locals correctly excluded). swift REFUTED -> regression INV-lanaz (383 of 407 SwiftyJSON fields are method-local let/var; scope-conflation in the F5 swift slice). go PARTIAL -> pre-existing INV-sidab (function-local var leaks as module variable). csharp PARTIAL -> INV-dakit (expression-bodied properties not emitted; out of F5 field/variable scope; C# field emission itself correct 11/11). Stripping awaits_bakeoff_validation: validation performed; 5 moved langs validated right-reason, 3 defects tracked as discrete INVs. WI-jusus stays todo_hard for the non-gated analyzer tail plus INV-lanaz (swift fix = next actionable). Lab notebook notebookjournal_06232026_1411.md; repro /tmp/f5_verify.py and /tmp/f5_samples and workflow f5-groundtruth-audit."  # f1f6
